## 4.4 General Ledger API — API-011

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/journal-entries` |
| Layanan | SVC-007 gl-service |
| Tabel | `gl.journal_entry`, `gl.journal_line`, `gl.account_balance` |
| Referensi | BR-556–562 (9.5.4) |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                              | Deskripsi                                      | Catatan |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | ------- |
| `POST /v1/journal-entries`                 | Buat jurnal draft (Idempotency-Key).           | 201     |
| `POST /v1/journal-entries/{id}/post`       | Posting jurnal (validasi balanced & period).   | EOS event |
| `POST /v1/journal-entries/{id}/reverse`    | Balik jurnal (reversal).                        | EOS event |
| `GET /v1/journal-entries?period=…&status=Posted` | Cari jurnal.                             |         |
| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}/balances?period=…`  | Saldo akun per periode (`gl.account_balance`).  |         |

**Skema `JournalEntry` (create request):**

```json
{
  "financialOrganizationId": "uuid",
  "ledgerId": "uuid",
  "postingDate": "2026-08-05",
  "journalSource": "Manual",
  "currency": "IDR",
  "exchangeRate": "1.00000000",
  "lines": [
    { "accountId": "uuid", "debitAmount": "1000.0000", "creditAmount": "0.0000", "costCenterId": "uuid" },
    { "accountId": "uuid", "debitAmount": "0.0000", "creditAmount": "1000.0000" }
  ]
}
```

**Validasi (BR-556, BR-562):**

* `SUM(debitAmount) = SUM(creditAmount)` → jika tidak, `422 GL_JOURNAL_UNBALANCED`.
* Periode target harus `Open` → jika `Closed/Locked`, `409 GL_PERIOD_LOCKED`.
* Sukses `post` → *event* `erp.gl.journal.posted.v1` (Exactly-Once, BAB 7.4).

