## 4.8 Treasury / Cash & Bank API — API-015

| Atribut | Nilai |
| --- | --- |
| Base path | `/v1/bank-accounts`, `/v1/payments` |
| Layanan | SVC-011 treasury-cashbank-service |
| Tabel | `trs.bank_account`, `trs.payment`, `trs.bank_statement_line` |
| Referensi | 9.5.8/9, INT-005 |

**Endpoint kunci:**

| Method & Path                              | Deskripsi                                      | Catatan |
| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | ------- |
| `POST /v1/payments`                         | Buat pembayaran/penerimaan (Idempotency-Key).  | EOS     |
| `POST /v1/payments/{id}/settle`             | Settle via bank/payment gateway (INT-005).     | EOS event |
| `POST /v1/bank-accounts/{id}/reconcile`     | Rekonsiliasi mutasi bank.                      |         |
| `GET /v1/payments?status=Settled&party=…`   | Daftar pembayaran.                             |         |

Pembayaran bersifat **Exactly-Once** (ADR-005); `settle` menghasilkan `erp.cashbank.payment.settled.v1`.

